    "name": "Archaic",
    "steam_appid": 2707540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/e52402ca66905a080134e9c3e75e674d.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>DINOSAURS? Yes, of course! Hunt down (or be hunted down by) over 50 different creatures on the island! From Tyrannosaurus Rex to Mosasaurus, (yes the waters are alive as well!) flee from, kill or tame many different creatures that come in all shapes and sizes, from babies to elders, all of which have randomized strengths!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/1f70ac1cef01e636d33ca116935366a8.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>A survival game isn't a survival game if you don't need to find food and water. While you explore the island, attend to your most basic needs and quickly build yourself a shelter if you'd like to survive!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/3dd43a0b07879f64e4ce7d2c61957357.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>Gather wood, fiber, and more to craft tools or bases with your friends then how about making a huge base and being the most powerful tribe of the server? Or being the one to pillage someone's base and steal their loot? Make friends of your enemies and enemies your friends, or not, the choice is yours!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/69efa4628e88bca65082cf1d56860e0a.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>What's better than a dinosaur survival game in VR? A <strong>multiplayer </strong>dinosaur survival game in VR. Make your tribe, and explore the dangerous island together while being cautious of multiple randomized hazards and creatures!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/e52402ca66905a080134e9c3e75e674d.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>DINOSAURS? Yes, of course! Hunt down (or be hunted down by) over 50 different creatures on the island! From Tyrannosaurus Rex to Mosasaurus, (yes the waters are alive as well!) flee from, kill or tame many different creatures that come in all shapes and sizes, from babies to elders, all of which have randomized strengths!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/1f70ac1cef01e636d33ca116935366a8.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>A survival game isn't a survival game if you don't need to find food and water. While you explore the island, attend to your most basic needs and quickly build yourself a shelter if you'd like to survive!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/3dd43a0b07879f64e4ce7d2c61957357.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>Gather wood, fiber, and more to craft tools or bases with your friends then how about making a huge base and being the most powerful tribe of the server? Or being the one to pillage someone's base and steal their loot? Make friends of your enemies and enemies your friends, or not, the choice is yours!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707540/extras/69efa4628e88bca65082cf1d56860e0a.avif?t=1719115381\" width=550 height=184 /></span><br><br>What's better than a dinosaur survival game in VR? A <strong>multiplayer </strong>dinosaur survival game in VR. Make your tribe, and explore the dangerous island together while being cautious of multiple randomized hazards and creatures!",
    "short_description": "Stranded on an unknown island, you must quickly learn to survive. You will be hunted down by about 50 different prehistoric creatures roaming around the island and its waters! Strive by gathering resources to craft tools and defenses, and by taming dangerous dinosaurs alone or with your friends!",
